From: Ning <hwn123123@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Native phone home with persistent touch ordering

Extend the existing shell with a clock home, horizontal apps page and fixed
favorites dock. Keep recent tasks separate from the home view, and return
home with a touch tap on the persistent bottom handle. Store ordering in
GSettings and reorder with GTK gestures inside the shell, leaving the
compositor and Android display path intact. Match the audio template to the
existing PhoshChannelBar type.

